{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">My Pet Hooligan is a vibrant, satirical, 3rd person shooter-platformer filled with cartoon chaos and destruction with both PvP and PvE experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/1SteamBanners_ExploreHoolilandCity.png?t=1747344626\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Platform across the city to find new vantage points to eliminate your enemies. Skateboard like a pro-skater and build trick combos to boost your traversal speed..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/MPH_Skateboarding_616.png?t=1747344626\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/2SteamBanners_ExplodeTheCity.png?t=1747344626\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eliminate enemies with an arsenal of comical weapons from flamethrowers to toilet plungers. Destroy the cars, crates, and barrels for extra explodey chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/MPH_Destruction_616.png?t=1747344626\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/3SteamBanners_Faction.png?t=1747344626\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pledge allegiance to one of seven factions, from the athletic Rogue Jumpers to the bionic Cypherbuns. Raise the ranks and unlock unique perks to aid you in your battle for control over Hooliland City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/4SteamBanners_CompeteInBattle.png?t=1747344626\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your abilities to the test with both PvP and PvE experiences. Play with friends in a variety of modes including: Sandbox, Free-for-All, and Team Deathmatch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/MPH_Combat_616.png?t=1747344626\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/5SteamBanners_CustomizeYourHooligan.png?t=1747344626\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your Hooligan and flex your sick drip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/MPH_Customize_616.png?t=1747344626\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/6SteamBanners_EarnRealWorldBanners.png?t=1747344626\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn Street Kred, raise up the leaderboard, and unlock rewards IRL.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/MPH_Rewards_616.png?t=1747344626\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574840?t=1747344626","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamst