ur Hooligan and flex your sick drip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/MPH_Customize_616.png?t=1747344626\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/6SteamBanners_EarnRealWorldBanners.png?t=1747344626\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn Street Kred, raise up the leaderboard, and unlock rewards IRL.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/MPH_Rewards_616.png?t=1747344626\" /></p>","developers":["AMGI Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/c632dfefb46108784252461ae9194f48df41be41/header.jpg?t=1747344626","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257109913,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109913/movie480.mp4?t=1741969382","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109913/movie_max.mp4?t=1741969382"},"name":"My Pet Hooligan","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257109913/70648dc78c291dd8169f23e2d939e299f4e4faf8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741969382","webm":{"480":"http: